/* 底栏：平的，一条细线。选中项 = 该 tab 专属姿势的犀鸟 + 星光色字；切换时只换图，不做任何动画 */
.bar { position: fixed; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; z-index: 99; display: flex; padding: 8rpx 16rpx calc(8rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); background: var(--bar); border-top: 2rpx solid var(--hair); }
.it { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; height: 104rpx; }
.ic { width: 88rpx; height: 68rpx; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
.svg { width: 44rpx; height: 44rpx; opacity: .8; }
.bird { width: 64rpx; height: 64rpx; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--photo); border: 2rpx solid var(--star); box-sizing: border-box; }
.t { font-size: 22rpx; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--ink2); letter-spacing: 1rpx; }
.it.on .t { color: var(--star); }
